    <bpmn:process id="W_W4577" name="W4577. Trade-In Program Strategy, Scope &amp; Economics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (VS-33); ESG/circular goal (VS-25/VS-73); category review
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: One trade-in program strategy
Owner: Merchandising (VS-01) / Circular-economy Lead / Commercial
Participants: Service Center (VS-12.1), Returns (VS-32), ESG (VS-25), Pricing (VS-01.2), Finance (VS-17.4)
Source: workflow W4577 — Trade-In Program Strategy, Scope &amp; Economics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4577_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4577_Lane1" name="Merchandising">
