        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-695 (ensure controlled execution — Trade-In/Buy-Back Program Design, Valuation &amp; Pricing (PA-155.1).) | - CTL-695: strategy ESG-aligned (VS-25/VS-73); economics modeled &amp; approved (VS-36); scope refurbishable
Owner: Merchandising (VS-01) / Circular-economy Lead / Commercial</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
