    <bpmn:process id="W_W4578" name="W4578. Eligible-Product &amp; Take-Back Channel Policy" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (W4577); category/condition rule
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Eligibility policy across eligible categories
Owner: Merchandising (VS-01) / Service Center (VS-12.1)
Participants: Stores (VS-07), Returns (VS-32), Quality (VS-31), Compliance (VS-22)
Source: workflow W4578 — Eligible-Product &amp; Take-Back Channel Policy</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4578_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4578_Lane1" name="Merchandising">
