    <bpmn:process id="W_W4580" name="W4580. Trade-In Credit, Pricing &amp; New-Purchase Linkage" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer accepts valuation (W4579); new purchase
Frequency: Per trade-in transaction
Volume: Trade-in credits across transactions
Owner: Merchandising / POS (VS-08) / Pricing
Participants: Stores (VS-07), Finance (VS-17), CRM/Loyalty (VS-13), Tax (VS-79)
Source: workflow W4580 — Trade-In Credit, Pricing &amp; New-Purchase Linkage</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4580_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4580_Lane1" name="Stores">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4580_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4580_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4580_Lane2" name="POS">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4580_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4580_Lane3" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4580_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4580_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4580_Start5" name="Customer accepts valuation (W4579); new purchase">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4580_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4580_Task6" name="Stores/POS issue the trade-in credit (store credit/gift-card VS-54, or loyalty…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Stores/POS issue the trade-in credit (store credit/gift-card VS-54, or loyalty points VS-13, or cash buy-back) at the accepted valuation (W4579), linked to the new-purchase basket
Responsible (R): Stores / POS / Merchandising
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4580_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
