      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program setup (W4577); system need
Frequency: Per setup + continuous
Volume: One pre-owned systems/item-coding setup
Owner: IT (VS-27) / Master Data (VS-29) / Merchandising
Participants: EA (VS-113), Inventory (VS-05), Auto-ID (VS-151), Finance (VS-17)
Source: workflow W4584 — Systems, Item-Coding &amp; Inventory Setup for Pre-Owned</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4584_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4584_Lane1" name="IT">
