      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4584_Task6" name="IT/EA/Master Data set up item-coding for pre-owned (distinct SKU/serial for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: IT/EA/Master Data set up item-coding for pre-owned (distinct SKU/serial for each certified unit, grade, acquisition cost, refurb cost — unique-item tracking vs standard SKU), per VS-29/VS-113
Responsible (R): IT / Master Data / EA
Accountable (A): CIO / Master Data Manager
Duration: Per setup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4584_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4584_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4584_Task7" name="Inventory/Auto-ID manage pre-owned inventory (serial-tracked, condition/grade…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Inventory/Auto-ID manage pre-owned inventory (serial-tracked, condition/grade, separate stock from new VS-05, Auto-ID/labeling VS-151 — &quot;certified pre-owned&quot; label)
Responsible (R): Inventory / Auto-ID
Accountable (A): Inventory Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4584_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4584_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4584_Task8" name="Finance/IT account pre-owned inventory (acquisition cost as inventory, refurb…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/IT account pre-owned inventory (acquisition cost as inventory, refurb cost capitalization, resale COGS — distinct from new-product accounting VS-17)
Responsible (R): Finance / IT
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4584_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4584_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4584_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
