        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-695 (ensure controlled execution — Trade-In/Buy-Back Program Design, Valuation &amp; Pricing (PA-155.1).) | - CTL-695 (pre-owned distinct SKU/serial &amp; labeled (not conflated with new VS-118); inventory separated (VS-05); accounted distinctly (VS-17))
Owner: IT (VS-27) / Master Data (VS-29) / Merchandising</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
